#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the IBM Quantum Compute client so you can run jobs with IBM Quantum Compute Service."
msgstr "Nainstaluj klienta IBM Quantum Compute, abys mohl spouštět úlohy se službou IBM Quantum Compute Service."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the IBM Quantum Compute client"
msgstr "Instalace klienta IBM Quantum Compute"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore manylinux miniconda */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore manylinux miniconda */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the IBM Quantum Compute client {#install-the-ibm-quantum-compute-client}"
msgstr "Instalace klienta IBM Quantum Compute {#install-the-ibm-quantum-compute-client}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Compute Service is the cloud-based service for executing quantum computations on IBM Quantum&reg; hardware. This guide shows you how to install `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, which is the client package for accessing IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum Compute Service je cloudová služba pro provádění kvantových výpočtů na hardwaru IBM Quantum&reg;. Tento průvodce ti ukáže, jak nainstalovat `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, což je klientský balíček pro přístup ke službě IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before installing the `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, follow the instructions in these guides:\n"
msgstr "Před instalací `qiskit-ibm-runtime` postupuj podle pokynů v těchto průvodcích:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit). \n"
msgstr "[Instalace Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Set up your IBM Cloud account](cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr "[Nastavení účtu IBM Cloud](cloud-setup).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run this command to install the IBM Quantum Compute client:\n"
msgstr "Spusť tento příkaz pro instalaci klienta IBM Quantum Compute:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Stay current with the latest versions\">\n"
"Periodically check the [`qiskit-ibm-runtime` release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes) to see new releases. We recommend frequently updating your requirements for `qiskit-ibm-runtime` by running `pip install -U qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Udržuj se aktuální s nejnovějšími verzemi\">\n"
"Pravidelně kontroluj [poznámky k vydání `qiskit-ibm-runtime`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes), abys viděl nová vydání. Doporučujeme často aktualizovat své požadavky pro `qiskit-ibm-runtime` spuštěním `pip install -U qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Další kroky {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - [Install the Qiskit SDK from source](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Run your first program](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Try a tutorial, such as [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"  - Review the [deprecation policy](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Doporučení\">\n"
"  - [Nainstaluj Qiskit SDK ze zdrojového kódu](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Spusť svůj první program](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Vyzkoušej výukový program, například [Groverův algoritmus](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"  - Projdi si [zásady zastarávání](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
